"- Learn how to [test locally](local-testing-mode) before running on quantum computers.\n"
"- Review detailed [examples](sampler-examples).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](transpile/) section.\n"
"- Try the [Compare transpiler settings](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings) guide.\n"
"- Learn how to [use the primitive options](/guides/runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- View the API for [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-sampler-options) options.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Raccomandazioni\">\n"
"- Scopri come [testare localmente](local-testing-mode) prima di eseguire su computer quantistici.\n"
"- Consulta [esempi](sampler-examples) dettagliati.\n"
"- Fai pratica con le primitive svolgendo la [lezione sulle funzioni di costo](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Scopri come effettuare la transpilazione localmente nella sezione [Transpila](transpile/).\n"
"- Prova la guida [Confronta le impostazioni del Transpiler](/guides/circuit-transpilation-settings#compare-transpiler-settings).\n"
"- Scopri come [utilizzare le opzioni delle primitive](/guides/runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Visualizza l'API per le opzioni di [Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-sampler-options).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
